# Independent audit: commit AUDIT.md, areas, backtest, evidence, tools, the root
# proof scripts and the audit/contracts and audit/npm copies. Ignore what the
# audit commands regenerate. audit/contracts/lib is a local absolute symlink
# (no trailing slash, so git matches the link); recreate it with
# ln -s ../../contracts/lib audit/contracts/lib
audit/npm-cache/
audit/npm-logs/
audit/npm/node_modules/
audit/contracts/out*/
audit/contracts/cache*/
audit/contracts/broadcast/
audit/contracts/lib
audit/web-postcss-proof/
audit/web-worker-proof/
audit/**/__pycache__/
.vercel
.env*
!.env.example

# Rust build output (Stylus pricer)
stylus/target/

# Local Claude Code permissions
.claude/
